  "DIFFERING_KERNELS_ARE_EXPECTED": "\u00a77 v1.6.29 SPLIT the `platform` key: `platform_abi` (arch+libc) is COMPARED and still refuses; `platform` (the full string, kernel included) is RECORDED on every artifact and NEVER compared. A future reader seeing different kernels across boxes is seeing the amendment working, NOT a fault. Any OTHER of the 16 keys differing IS a fault.",
