  "OFFER_ID_PROVENANCE": "offer_id is NOT recoverable from `vastai show instances` \u2014 no field carries it. It is recorded here from the create log, and corroborated independently by (host_id, price) ordering: offers 13651731/37930542 were host 87485 at $0.4419/$0.4423 and 38138032 was host 81036 at $0.6023; the instances are host 87485/87485/81036 billing $0.4622/$0.4678/$0.6278 in the same order. A re-rent depends on this mapping, so it is stated with its evidence rather than asserted.",
  "R2_STAMP_NOTE": "r2's stamp was taken AFTER this record was first written (it was still installing), so the file carried kernel=None for it. Re-stamped mid-run via m6_money_run.py::preflight_provenance and verified byte-identical to its provisioning stamp; all 16 compared keys agree with r0 and r1. The record is now complete for all three boxes.",
